1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,000
1. Begin without the new feature
The existing app is running. Neither group can use the feature yet.

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:30,000
2. Deploy code with the flag off
The app now contains the feature code, but its flag is OFF for everyone. There is still no user-visible release.

3
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:45,000
3. Enable it for a selected group
Turn the flag ON for test users. Everyone runs the deployed app, but only the chosen group sees the feature.

4
00:00:45,000 --> 00:01:00,000
4. Release when you are ready
Enable the flag for everyone. This changes feature availability without requiring another code deployment.
